Package: ccontrol
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: wireplumber | pulseaudio-utils, xdg-utils
Maintainer: ccontrol maintainers <maintainers@ccontrol.invalid>
Description: ccontrol desktop agent
 Local-first agent that lets paired Android phones control this computer
 (volume, media, telemetry) over an authenticated TLS 1.3 LAN connection.
 Nothing is exposed until a phone is explicitly approved on this computer.
